# Claude Code Instructions for this project

## Package Management
- ALWAYS use `uv` instead of `pip` for package management
- Use `uv pip install <package>` instead of `pip install <package>`
- Use `uv pip sync requirements.txt` for syncing dependencies
- Use `uv run <command>` to run commands in the virtual environment

## Virtual Environment
- Virtual environment directory is `.venv` (not `venv`)
- Activate with `.venv\Scripts\activate` (Windows) or `source .venv/bin/activate` (Unix)

## Project Structure
- Configuration: Use `utils` module (not `helpers`)
- Config loading: `from utils import load_config_from_yaml`
- Mist sessions: `from utils import get_mist_session, get_requests_session`

## Dependencies
- All dependencies must be pinned to specific versions in requirements.txt
- Use `make add PACKAGE=name` to add new packages
- Use `make remove PACKAGE=name` to remove packages

## Testing
- Run tests with `make test` or `uv run pytest tests/ -v`
- Tests are in the `tests/` directory

## Common Commands
```bash
make setup       # Initial setup with uv
make install     # Install dependencies
make sync        # Sync dependencies (faster)
make test        # Run tests
make add PACKAGE=name    # Add package
make remove PACKAGE=name # Remove package
```
